Package: apiGuard
Title: Detect Breaking API Changes Between R Package Versions
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Fabian", "Distler", email = "fdistlermpi@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compares the public API of two versions of an R package
    (exported functions, formal arguments, default values, argument order)
    and classifies every change as breaking, feature, or behaviour-level.
    Suggests a semantic version bump, generates a NEWS.md section, and
    provides a CI gate that fails on breaking changes. Works statically on
    package sources (no installation required) and can compare git refs,
    so it also works pre-CRAN-release.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/fabiandistler/apiGuard, https://fabiandistler.github.io/apiGuard/
BugReports: https://github.com/fabiandistler/apiGuard/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
